{"id":"f5ce7b24fbc31ae5","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-quadratic-form.md","title":"Quadratic Form","display":"df-quadratic-form — Quadratic Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-quadratic-form","aliases":["58-df-quadratic-form","Quadratic Form"],"display":"df-quadratic-form — Quadratic Form","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-quadratic-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-quadratic-form</span><span>Quadratic Form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quadratic-form — Quadratic Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,k,Q,B\\in V\">\\(V,k,Q,B\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\)</span> is the fully structured predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quadratic\\text{-}form}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S(Q,V,k) \\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_V,\\odot,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q,V,k)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,V\\times V,k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in k\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\nQ(\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,x\\rangle))\n=\\cdot_k(\\langle\\cdot_k(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle),Q(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\n+_k\\!\\left(\\left\\langle B(\\langle x,y\\rangle),\n+_k(\\langle Q(x),Q(y)\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\n=Q(+_V(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in V\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in k\\;\\Bigl(\nB(\\langle+_V(\\langle x,y\\rangle),z\\rangle)\n=+_k(\\langle B(\\langle x,z\\rangle),B(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land B(\\langle x,+_V(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\n=+_k(\\langle B(\\langle x,y\\rangle),B(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land B(\\langle\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,x\\rangle),y\\rangle)\n=\\cdot_k(\\langle\\alpha,B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land B(\\langle x,\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\n=\\cdot_k(\\langle\\alpha,B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quadratic\\text{-}form}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S(Q,V,k) \\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_V,\\odot,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q,V,k)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,V\\times V,k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in k\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\nQ(\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,x\\rangle))\n=\\cdot_k(\\langle\\cdot_k(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle),Q(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\n+_k\\!\\left(\\left\\langle B(\\langle x,y\\rangle),\n+_k(\\langle Q(x),Q(y)\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\n=Q(+_V(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in V\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in k\\;\\Bigl(\nB(\\langle+_V(\\langle x,y\\rangle),z\\rangle)\n=+_k(\\langle B(\\langle x,z\\rangle),B(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land B(\\langle x,+_V(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\n=+_k(\\langle B(\\langle x,y\\rangle),B(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land B(\\langle\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,x\\rangle),y\\rangle)\n=\\cdot_k(\\langle\\alpha,B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land B(\\langle x,\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\n=\\cdot_k(\\langle\\alpha,B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Quadratic form: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(x) = \\langle x, Ax \\rangle\">\\(Q(x) = \\langle x, Ax \\rangle\\)</span> for symmetric <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span></li>\n<li>The polar form is bound as a graph using the same displayed field and vector-space operations. This definition also works in characteristic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> and therefore does not require an undefined characteristic operator or division by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Signature: numbers of positive, negative, zero eigenvalues</li>\n<li>Classification: over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}\\)</span> by rank and signature</li>\n<li>Positive definiteness additionally requires an ordered field and is not defined for arbitrary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Roman, Advanced Linear Algebra</li>\n<li>Hirschfeld, Poznak and Wax, Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S$ is the fully structured predicate from [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,k,Q,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quadratic\\text{-}form}\\vdash{}&\n\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S(Q,V,k) \\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_V,\\odot,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[{}&\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q,V,k)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,V\\times V,k)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in k\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\nQ(\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,x\\rangle))\n=\\cdot_k(\\langle\\cdot_k(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle),Q(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\n+_k\\!\\left(\\left\\langle B(\\langle x,y\\rangle),\n+_k(\\langle Q(x),Q(y)\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\n=Q(+_V(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in V\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in k\\;\\Bigl(\nB(\\langle+_V(\\langle x,y\\rangle),z\\rangle)\n=+_k(\\langle B(\\langle x,z\\rangle),B(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land B(\\langle x,+_V(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\n=+_k(\\langle B(\\langle x,y\\rangle),B(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land B(\\langle\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,x\\rangle),y\\rangle)\n=\\cdot_k(\\langle\\alpha,B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land B(\\langle x,\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\n=\\cdot_k(\\langle\\alpha,B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Q(x) = \\langle x, Ax \\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":2384,"backlinks":[{"id":"2149ce014462d47d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{QuadraticForm}_S$ (quadratic-form predicate, see [[58-df-quadratic-form]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1021","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-quadratic-form.md|58-df-quadratic-form]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["592f9cfb66a507c2","36d7463d215be751"]}